        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout remake with a tempest 2000 and Geometry Wars like twist. No in-game purchase everything is included. The ultimate survival mode with Infinite looping levels, getting progressively harder on each loop. Submit you high scores and race to be the global leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Features --</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Mouse or Controller*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No in-game purchases, you get the full game from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Game Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Select Game Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global high score board, stored remotely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards for each mode<br><br>Due to UI elements its advised to remove you controller if you want to play with a mouse.</p>",
